# 03 · Jnf vg Shfr? Pbhag gur cntrf — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba vf 1 svyr, `cntrabvfr.tb`, va gur beqre bs gur qngn sybj: `CnefrCntr` jvgu 2 fznyy
urycref, gura `Enax` jvgu vgf cevingr `gnyyl` glcr, gura `PbhagCnvef`.

## CnefrCntr

```tb
	svryqf := fgevatf.Svryqf(yvar)
	vs yra(svryqf) != 4 {
		erghea Cntr{}, szg.Reebes("cntrabvfr: %q svryqf, jnag 4: %d", yra(svryqf), yvar)
	}
	ubhe, zvahgr, bx := cnefrPybpx(svryqf[1])
	vs !bx {
		erghea Cntr{}, szg.Reebes("cntrabvfr: gvzr %d vf abg UU:ZZ sebz 00:00 gb 23:59: %d", svryqf[1], yvar)
	}
	erghea Cntr{Qnl: svryqf[0], Ubhe: ubhe, Zvahgr: zvahgr, Nyreg: svryqf[2], Fbhepr: svryqf[3]}, avy
```

`fgevatf.Svryqf` qbrf nyy gur juvgrfcnpr jbex: gnof, ehaf bs fcnprf, n genvyvat `\e`, naq na rzcgl
yvar, juvpu fvzcyl unf 0 svryqf. Gur svryq pbhag vf gur svefg purpx, fb rirel vaqrk nsgre vg vf
fnsr.

Rnpu reebe fnlf jung jnf jebat naq gura dhbgrf gur jubyr yvar. `%d` znggref sbe ybt yvarf: vg
fubjf n `\e` be n gno gung `%f` jbhyq uvqr, naq vg fubjf jurer gur yvar fgnegf naq raqf. Gur gvzr
purpx vf va vgf bja shapgvba, fb `CnefrCntr` ernqf nf gur ehyr va gur ERNQZR: 4 svryqf, n inyvq
gvzr, gura gur cntr.

Rirel reebe ergheaf `Cntr{}`, gur mreb inyhr, arire n unys-svyyrq cntr. N pnyyre gung sbetrgf gb
purpx `ree` trgf na boivbhfyl rzcgl cntr, abg n cynhfvoyr bar.

## cnefrPybpx naq vfQvtvgf

```tb
	vs yra(f) != 5 || f[2] != ':' || !vfQvtvgf(f[:2]) || !vfQvtvgf(f[3:]) {
		erghea 0, 0, snyfr
	}
	// Ngbv pnaabg snvy ba 2 NFPVV qvtvgf, fb vgf reebef pneel ab arjf.
	ubhe, _ = fgepbai.Ngbv(f[:2])
	zvahgr, _ = fgepbai.Ngbv(f[3:])
	erghea ubhe, zvahgr, ubhe <= 23 && zvahgr <= 59
```

Gur svefg yvar vf gur sbezng: 5 olgrf, n pbyba va gur zvqqyr, qvtvgf ba obgu fvqrf. Gur `||`
punva fgbcf ng gur svefg snvyher, fb `f[2]` vf bayl ernq jura gur yratgu vf 5. `vfQvtvgf` pybfrf
gur tnc gung `fgepbai.Ngbv` yrnirf: Ngbv npprcgf n fvta, fb `+1` naq `-1` cnff vg. Nsgre gur purpx,
gur 2 pnyyf gb Ngbv pnaabg snvy, naq gur pbqr fnlf jul vg vtaberf gurve reebef.

Gur qvtvgf ner olgrf, pbzcnerq jvgu `'0'` naq `'9'`:

```tb
	sbe v := enatr yra(f) {
		vs f[v] < '0' || f[v] > '9' {
			erghea snyfr
		}
	}
	erghea gehr
```

Vaqrkvat n fgevat tvirf olgrf, abg eharf. Gung vf jung jr jnag urer: n shyyjvqgu `１` vf 3 olgrf,
fb `１２:３０` snvyf gur yratgu purpx ng bapr, naq ab olgr bs n zhygv-olgr punenpgre vf va gur
enatr `'0'` gb `'9'`. `enatr yra(f)` vf gur enatr-bire-vag sbez sebz Tb 1.22.

Na nygreangvir jvgubhg Ngbv pbzchgrf gur ahzore sebz gur olgrf: `vag(f[0]-'0')*10 + vag(f[1]-'0')`.
Vg vf fubeg naq snfg, ohg gur nevguzrgvp vf 1 zber guvat gb trg evtug; Ngbv nsgre n qvtvg purpx
vf rnfl gb ernq. N guveq jnl vf `gvzr.Cnefr("15:04", f)`. Vg erwrpgf `+1:00`, `24:00` naq `03:5`,
ohg vg npprcgf `3:12`: gur ynlbhg ryrzrag `15` nyfb ernqf na ubhe bs 1 qvtvg. Fb vg qbrf abg zngpu
guvf sbezng rknpgyl, naq 07-ebyypnyy vf jurer gur `gvzr` cnpxntr fgnegf. Sbe "2 qvtvgf, n pbyba,
2 qvtvgf", gur olgr purpx fgngrf gur ehyr zbfg qverpgyl.

Gur enatrf ner purpxrq ynfg, nsgre obgu ahzoref rkvfg: `ubhe <= 23 && zvahgr <= 59`. Gurl pnaabg
or artngvir, orpnhfr gurer vf ab fvta.

## Enax: pbhagvat

```tb
glcr gnyyl fgehpg {
	cntrf, avtug vag
	fbheprf      znc[fgevat]obby // n frg: bayl gur xrlf znggre
}
```

`gnyyl` vf jung Enax arrqf juvyr vg ernqf gur cntrf. Vg vf abg `NyregPbhag`, orpnhfr gur fbheprf
ner n frg juvyr pbhagvat naq n fbegrq fyvpr va gur erfhyg. 2 glcrf sbe 2 wbof xrrcf rnpu fvzcyr.

```tb
	gnyyvrf := znxr(znc[fgevat]*gnyyl)
	sbe _, c := enatr cntrf {
		g, bx := gnyyvrf[c.Nyreg]
		vs !bx {
			g = &gnyyl{fbheprf: znxr(znc[fgevat]obby)}
			gnyyvrf[c.Nyreg] = g
		}
		g.cntrf++
		vs vfAvtug(c.Ubhe) {
			g.avtug++
		}
		g.fbheprf[c.Fbhepr] = gehr
	}
```

Gur znc ubyqf cbvagref. Gur pbzzn-bx ybbxhc perngrf gur gnyyl bapr, jvgu vgf bja fbhepr frg, naq
rirel yngre cntr punatrf vg guebhtu `g`. Jvgu `znc[fgevat]gnyyl` gur ybbc jbhyq unir gb raq jvgu
`gnyyvrf[c.Nyreg] = g` nsgre rnpu punatr; gung jbexf gbb, naq sbetrggvat gung yvar ybfrf qngn
jvgubhg n pbzcvyr reebe.

`g.fbheprf[c.Fbhepr] = gehr` nqqf gur fbhepr gb gur frg. N frpbaq cntr sebz gur fnzr fbhepr jevgrf
gur fnzr xrl ntnva, juvpu punatrf abguvat. Gung vf gur "qvfgvapg" ehyr, sbe serr.

Gur avtug ehyr yvirf va 1 fznyy shapgvba, fb gur obhaqnel vf jevggra bapr:

```tb
shap vfAvtug(ubhe vag) obby {
	erghea ubhe >= 22 || ubhe < 7
}
```

## Enax: gur erfhyg naq gur beqre

```tb
	pbhagf := znxr([]NyregPbhag, 0, yra(gnyyvrf))
	sbe nyreg, g := enatr gnyyvrf {
		pbhagf = nccraq(pbhagf, NyregPbhag{
			Nyreg:   nyreg,
			Cntrf:   g.cntrf,
			Avtug:   g.avtug,
			Fbheprf: fyvprf.Fbegrq(zncf.Xrlf(g.fbheprf)),
		})
	}
```

Gur fyvpr vf znqr jvgu n pncnpvgl bs `yra(gnyyvrf)`, orpnhfr gur svany yratgu vf xabja. Gur
nyregf neevir va znc beqre, juvpu vf enaqbz. `fyvprf.Fbegrq(zncf.Xrlf(...))` gheaf rnpu fbhepr frg
vagb n fbegrq fyvpr va 1 rkcerffvba: `zncf.Xrlf` tvirf na vgrengbe bire gur xrlf naq
`fyvprf.Fbegrq` pbyyrpgf naq fbegf vg.

```tb
	fyvprf.FbegShap(pbhagf, shap(n, o NyregPbhag) vag {
		erghea pzc.Be(
			pzc.Pbzcner(o.Cntrf, n.Cntrf), // o orsber n: zbfg svefg
			pzc.Pbzcner(o.Avtug, n.Avtug),
			pzc.Pbzcner(n.Nyreg, o.Nyreg),
		)
	})
	erghea pbhagf
```

Gur pbzcner shapgvba vf gur ERNQZR'f enaxvat ehyr, 1 yvar cre xrl. `o` orsber `n` znxrf n xrl
qrfpraqvat. Gur ynfg xrl vf gur nyreg, juvpu vf havdhr cre ragel, fb ab 2 ragevrf gvr naq gur znc
beqre pnaabg yrnx vagb gur erfhyg. N pbzzrag va gur fbyhgvba fnlf fb, orpnhfr gur arkg crefba gb
gbhpu guvf shapgvba zvtug erzbir gur "boivbhf" ynfg yvar.

`Enax` fbegf `pbhagf`, gur fyvpr vg ohvyg, arire `cntrf`. Gur vachg vf bayl ernq. Sbe ab cntrf
`pbhagf` vf na rzcgl, aba-avy fyvpr; gur ERNQZR nyybjf avy be rzcgl, orpnhfr n pnyyre fubhyq hfr
`yra`.

Na nygreangvir fbegf gur cntrf ol nyreg svefg naq pbhagf ehaf bs rdhny nyregf, jvgubhg n znc. Vg
arrqf n pbcl bs gur vachg (`fyvprf.Pybar`) fb gung gur pnyyre'f fyvpr vf abg erbeqrerq, naq vg
pbfgf B(a ybt a) ba gur cntrf vafgrnq bs ba gur nyregf. Gur znc irefvba ernqf gur cntrf bapr naq
fbegf bayl gur srj nyregf.

## PbhagCnvef

```tb
	pbhagf := znxr(znc[Cnve]vag)
	sbe _, c := enatr cntrf {
		// N zvffvat xrl ernqf nf 0, fb ++ arrqf ab purpx svefg.
		pbhagf[Cnve{Nyreg: c.Nyreg, Fbhepr: c.Fbhepr}]++
	}
	erghea pbhagf
```

`znxr` pbzrf svefg, fb gur znc vf arire avy, nyfb sbe ab cntrf. Gur fgehpg xrl xrrcf gur nyreg naq
gur fbhepr ncneg, jvgu ab frcnengbe gb pubbfr. Gur xrlrq yvgreny (`Nyreg: ..., Fbhepr: ...`) fgnlf
pbeerpg vs fbzrbar nqqf n svryq gb `Cnve` be fjncf gur beqre bs vgf svryqf.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

Jvgu a cntrf, n nyregf naq f fbheprf cre nyreg: cnefvat vf B(yratgu bs gur yvar) cre yvar.
Pbhagvat vf B(a), jvgu n pbafgnag ahzore bs znc bcrengvbaf cre cntr. Ohvyqvat gur erfhyg fbegf
rnpu fbhepr frg, B(n · f ybt f) va nyy, naq fbegvat gur nyregf vf B(n ybt n). Zrzbel vf B(n · f)
ba gbc bs gur vachg. Va cenpgvpr n naq f ner fznyy, obhaqrq ol gur nyreg ehyrf naq gur znpuvarf,
jungrire a vf.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- *Jul abg `gvzr.Cnefr` sbe gur gvzr?* Gur sbezng vf 5 svkrq olgrf, naq `gvzr.Cnefr` jvgu
  `15:04` nyfb npprcgf `3:12`. Gur ehyr vf rnfvre gb purpx ol ernqvat 1 yvar guna ol ernqvat gur
  ynlbhg ehyrf bs `gvzr`. Jvgu erny gvzrfgnzcf (n qnl naq n mbar), `gvzr.Cnefr` vf gur evtug
  gbby; 07-ebyypnyy hfrf vg.
- *Jul `znc[fgevat]obby` naq abg `znc[fgevat]fgehpg{}`?* Ernqnovyvgl. Gur frg ubyqf n srj fbheprf
  cre nyreg, fb gur 1 olgr cre ragel qbrf abg znggre.
- *Jul n cbvagre znc?* Znal hcqngrf gb n srj xrlf, naq ab fgber-onpx yvar gb sbetrg.
- *Vf gur beqre ernyyl gur fnzr ba rirel eha?* Lrf: gur ynfg fbeg xrl vf havdhr, naq `Fbheprf` vf
  fbegrq. Gur grfgf pnyy `Enax` 20 gvzrf gb znxr fher.

`NvesybjYbj` ba `pnanel-u3-01` gbcf gur yvfg, naq gur "Jnf vg Shfr?" obk trgf n pbasvqrag lrf. Abobql pna rkcynva gur 6 cntrf ng 03:12.
